  "description": "The Voltbike Enduro is back—and better than ever. Built to tackle steep climbs and challenging terrain, this proven hill-climber now comes standard with durable metal fenders and a rear rack, making it ready for year-round riding and everyday adventures.\nAt the heart of the Enduro is Bafang’s powerful M600 500W mid-drive motor, delivering an impressive 120 Nm of torque to help you conquer demanding climbs with confidence. Choose from multiple battery options featuring Samsung cells, giving you the power and range to make the most of every precious hour on the trail.\nHigh-quality suspension components, including a Trama TOP front suspension fork and RockShox Monarch R rear shock, deliver a significant upgrade in comfort, control, and performance over the previous Enduro. The 11-speed SRAM NX drivetrain provides smooth, precise, and reliable shifting, with X-HORIZON™ technology for faster shifts, reduced chain movement, and less chain slap. X-SYNC™ pulley wheels and CAGE LOCK™ technology provide efficient chain management and make wheel removal and installation quick and easy.\nA large colour LCD display mounted at the centre of the handlebars keeps essential ride information easy to see, while the automatic light sensor adjusts for changing conditions. An integrated USB charging port lets you keep compatible devices powered while you ride.",
